WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Luke blocks Ryu’s OD Shoryuken in the corner.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.150
Back heavy punch punishes the blocked reversal.

3
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:03.050
Crouching heavy punch links into Perfect light.

4
00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:03.850
Perfect light Flash Knuckle launches Ryu at the wall.

5
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:04.600
Jumping medium punch catches Ryu in the air.

6
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:05.400
The delayed short-held air light Knuckle continues the juggle.

7
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.850
Light Rising Uppercut finishes the corner punish.
